        <p>The iner;bera of this area, satin held a whiet drive last evening week at Atkineon's Cafe arid thr proceed- ing% were of a highly enjoyable character. A musical programme wart gone through. The old eehool and college rhorueea were much enjored and brought brck many happy recollections. Messrs. R. It. !lice, W. E. Wallington and E. isekaos Mee sang the soloe. The members were pleased to welcome Mr. E. S. A. Rolston ,principle Land Miss Wilkinann, of the erhool stall. The prlaea at whiat were won by Miss L. Lake and Mies D. Parsonage (tie), Liss A. Speakman (con- solation), Mr: 0. Sinclair and Mr. Ti Worthington , .• .</p>
