      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-02-04_WidnesExaminer_art0102" n="art0102">
        <head>Life's Shadow</head>
        <p>Life's Shadow</p>
        <p>When the shadow of sickness falls on your life; when hope begins to fade and friends look serious, then is the time when you should remember that thou- sands just as hopeless have been cured and restored to the Sunshine of Health by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills. _ . •</p>
        <p>Gradual wasting away; loss of weight; poor appetite; shadows under the eyes; a cough in winter--these threaten Con- sumption and Decline. Many such cases have been cured. The following is only one among thousands; another opposite.</p>
