        <head>LOCAL PARLIAMENT. P.::UMED -DEBATE ON THE HOUSE OF LORDS.</head>
        <p>LOCAL PARLIAMENT. P.::UMED -DEBATE ON THE HOUSE OF LORDS.</p>
        <p>Lively Passages. The debate on the Conservative Government's Bill to reform the House of Lords and institute the Referendum was resumed at the weekly meeting of the Warrington Parliamentary Debating Society in Cairo-street Church parlour on Tuesday evening. There wee. good attendance and the discussion was prudes- tiv.e. of st,icart.slivel y</p>
